  "summary": "A byte-bounded exact LRU inside the application process. Included in the budget rather than treated as free. Cache-aside: a miss takes a per-key fill lease, double-checks, loads a committed view and publishes it. A read that begins after a write to that key was acknowledged must not return an older value; a violation fails the cell. The legacy model supplies no token, so strict freshness rests on invalidation alone or on an authoritative read.",
